<p>This is the first edition. There is no previous year to point at, no archive of past delegates, and no attendance figure to quote. Everything published on this site is either confirmed by the secretariat or sourced and dated. Where something is not yet settled — the venue, the fees, the speakers — the page says so rather than filling the space.</p>
